      "answer": "The woman who portrayed Corliss Archer in the 1945 film *Kiss and Tell* was **Shirley Temple** (then 17 years old). \n\nAs an adult, Shirley Temple Black held several notable government positions within the United States:\n* She served as the **United States Ambassador to Ghana**.\n* She acted as the **United States Ambassador to Czechoslovakia**.\n* She also served as the **Chief of Protocol of the United States**.\n\n### References\n\n- [1] kiss_and_tell_1945_film.txt\n- [5] shirley_temple.txt",
